// shader-differential uniform-application control, uniform half.
//
// Output IS the uniform.  Paired against sd_uniform_baked.fcg (the
// same value as a literal) under a uniform set carrying that value:
// identical iff cellGcmSetFragmentProgramParameter actually patched
// the embedded constant.  Silent non-application shows the embedded
// default (the stager's zeros) and the pair judges mismatch — the
// failure mode an A/B rig cannot otherwise see, since applying no
// uniforms to BOTH sides of an ordinary pair still judges identical.
void main(uniform float4 u_color,
          out float4 color : COLOR)
{
    color = u_color;
}
